{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "82f6fd5a-a152-8295-af26-9940a7f3ab3d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T12:12:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Happy Tuesday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Sandra. I'm calling about stray cats. Well, feral cats, there's a whole colony of them back by the dumpsters behind my building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh boy. Okay. Whereabouts is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:10:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "257 Farewell Street, up in the North End. The dumpsters are around the side, by the lot. And I'll tell you, somebody keeps feeding them, which is just wonderful, because now there's eight or nine of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight or nine, wow. And have they been there a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Months. But after that snow-to-rain mess Sunday into Monday, they're all huddled under the dumpster lids and the pallets, so now you can't miss them. I'm literally drawing you a little map on the back of a receipt, hang on. Dumpsters here, the fence line there, the cats here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I love that. You're very organized."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somebody has to be. Anyway, my real problem is the kids. There are children who cut through that lot to get to the bus stop, and a couple of these cats are not friendly. One hissed at a little boy yesterday. Nobody's thinking about that, apparently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's a fair worry. Animal control handles that kind of thing. I can take down your information and send it over to them, and they'll look at it and decide how to respond."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please. And honestly, if they just trap them and fix them, fine, I don't care how, I just want it handled before somebody gets scratched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Can I get a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0191. That's my cell. If I don't pick up, leave a message, I'm at work half the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0191. So that's the colony by the dumpsters at 257 Farewell, concern about children cutting through. I'll pass it along today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, Sandra. I'd say it's about time, but that's not on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll take it anyway. You have a good afternoon, and stay warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. You too."
    }
  ],
